{"lines": [{"text": "Why you should never buy a diamond ring.", "start": 0.05, "end": 1.922, "spec": {"type": "hero"}, "words": [["Why", 0.086, 0.183], ["you", 0.183, 0.248], ["should", 0.259, 0.409], ["never", 0.409, 0.657], ["buy", 0.668, 0.797], ["a", 0.808, 0.84], ["diamond", 0.841, 1.142], ["ring", 1.153, 1.358]]}, {"text": "In nineteen forty-seven, an ad agency gave De Beers four words: a diamond is forever.", "start": 2.002, "end": 8.338, "spec": {"type": "ad"}, "words": [["In", 0.075, 0.14], ["nineteen", 0.14, 0.474], ["forty-seven", 0.474, 1.088], ["an", 1.509, 1.573], ["ad", 1.584, 1.789], ["agency", 1.789, 2.349], ["gave", 2.565, 2.78], ["De", 2.78, 2.877], ["Beers", 2.877, 3.265], ["four", 3.384, 3.728], ["words", 3.728, 4.17], ["a", 4.515, 4.58], ["diamond", 4.58, 5.075], ["is", 5.366, 5.453], ["forever", 5.463, 6.024]]}, {"text": "That slogan made a diamond ring the must-have for every engagement.", "start": 8.418, "end": 12.018, "spec": {"type": "must"}, "words": [["That", 0.075, 0.162], ["slogan", 0.162, 0.539], ["made", 0.55, 0.69], ["a", 0.69, 0.733], ["diamond", 0.744, 1.067], ["ring", 1.078, 1.282], ["the", 1.282, 1.336], ["must-have", 1.347, 1.94], ["for", 2.112, 2.317], ["every", 2.478, 2.726], ["engagement", 2.726, 3.276]]}, {"text": "But try selling one. One owner was offered just thirty-five percent of what he paid.", "start": 12.098, "end": 16.298, "spec": {"type": "resell"}, "words": [["But", 0.086, 0.151], ["try", 0.151, 0.334], ["selling", 0.334, 0.625], ["one", 0.636, 0.862], ["One", 1.218, 1.39], ["owner", 1.39, 1.595], ["was", 1.595, 1.724], ["offered", 1.735, 2.09], ["just", 2.091, 2.317], ["thirty-five", 2.328, 2.942], ["percent", 2.942, 3.319], ["of", 3.319, 3.362], ["what", 3.362, 3.448], ["he", 3.459, 3.513], ["paid", 3.513, 3.879]]}, {"text": "And natural diamond prices fell about thirty percent since twenty twenty-one.", "start": 16.378, "end": 20.362, "spec": {"type": "crash", "cut": true}, "words": [["And", 0.086, 0.162], ["n